msgctxt "DefaultTalk:594514:0:20"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>! Help yourself to a bowl of soup, if you'd like."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>! Угощайтесь супом, если хотите."

#. ja: 今後は、暫定政権主導のもと、<br>復興に力を注いでいくことになるでしょうな！
#. de: Ich werde mein Bestes geben, der Übergangsregierung beim Wieder<shy>aufbau von Ala Mhigo zu helfen.
#. fr: Une fois que le gouvernement de transition sera en place, son premier défi sera de rebâtir Ala Mhigo. Et nous serons de nouveau en première ligne pour mener ce combat<nbsp>!
#. column 21: 0
#. column 22: 0
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:594515:0:20"
msgid "Seems we'll soon be turning our efforts to rebuilding. Our new orders should be coming in any day now!"
msgstr "Похоже, скоро займёмся восстановлением. Новые приказы должны поступить со дня на день!"

#. ja: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さんは、<br>アラミゴにとって、忘れがたい存在です。<br>もちろん僕も、あなたのことは心に刻みますよ！
#. de: Das mhigische Volk wird dich auf ewig in seinen Liedern besingen, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Und auch ich habe dich fest in mein Herz geschlossen.
#. fr: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>, vous avez marqué de votre empreinte l'histoire d'Ala Mhigo. Votre nom ne sera pas oublié de sitôt, et je suis à peu près certain que même les enfants de mes enfants parleront encore de vous<nbsp>!
#. column 21: 0
#. column 22: 0
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:594516:0:20"
msgid "Ala Mhigo will not soon forget your name, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. For my part, I'll be sure to teach it to my children's children!"
msgstr "Ала-Миго ещё долго будет помнить твоё имя, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. А я непременно расскажу о тебе своим внукам!"

#. ja: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>殿の戦いぶり、私も耳にした。<br>さすが歴戦の英雄は違うな。
#. de: Ich habe von deinen hehren Taten gehört, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Du bist wahrlich <if $gn4>eine Heldin<else>ein Held</if>, wie es nur wenige gibt!
#. fr: Les soldats qui vous ont <if $gn4>vue<else>vu</if> à l'œuvre ne tarissent pas d'éloges concernant votre technique de combat. À leurs yeux, vous êtes <if $gn4>une héroïne<else>un héros</if> et un modèle.
#. column 21: 0
#. column 22: 0
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUlda… — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
